ry of telic processes (which is also often called “event” in\\n    the formal semantics literature), we will refer to as “performance”\\n    (see §[3](#aspectannotation)). 2.  We are considering using the <span>NA</span> value for non-real\\n    events as well, but for now, these types of events should receive\\n    one of the other aspect values. -->\\n\\n[Back to Table of Contents](#toc)\"}, {\"heading\": \"Uniform Meaning Representation (UMR) 0.9 Specification > Part 4. Document-Level Representation > Part 4-2. Temporal Dependency > Part 4-2-2-1. Choosing the right temporal relation > Part 4-2-2-1-1. Special cases (3/3)\", \"text\": \"```\\nHe went home (in order) to wash the dishes.\\n(s1g/ go-01\\n\\t:ARG1 (s1p/ person\\n\\t\\t:ref-person 3rd\\n\\t\\t:ref-number Singular)\\n\\t:ARG4 (s1h/ home)\\n\\t:purpose (s1w/ wash-01\\n\\t\\t:ARG0 s1p\\n\\t\\t:ARG1 (s1d/ dish\\n\\t\\t\\t:ref-number Plural)\\n\\t\\t:aspect Performance\\n\\t\\t:modstr FullAff)\\n\\t:aspect Performance\\n\\t:modstr FullAff)\\n\\n(s/ sentence\\n\\t:temporal ((PAST_REF :contained s1g)\\n\\t\\t (s1g :after s1w)))\\n\\n```\"}], \"found\": 24}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0196cqNdH6TAp2s1sxzJ3aNX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
